{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore","id":1447032,"title":"Question on: \"The Children of the Outer Dark\" (Baali Lore)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-02T14:19:52-07:00","id":1447032,"title":"Question on: \"The Children of the Outer Dark\" (Baali Lore)","content":"So, I've finally been taking a look through Clanbook Baali, the Lore of the Bloodlines, and the V20: Tal'Mahe'Ra book to find out more on the Baali, and one of the points of contention that I'm finding myself in, is on what the Children are. Are they supposed to be Earthbound, or some other spirit entity such as a neverborn? Some of their abilities seem like some of the Demonic Earthbound lores presented in D:TF. However in many supplements that detail the Baali, they keep the terms &quot;Demon&quot; different from &quot;Children&quot; as in to say that they're not the same? This entire process of trying to figure out what's what is confusing me. What do you all believe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26413-thatonekiasyd","name":"ThatOneKiasyd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26413_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T14:31:03-07:00","id":1447037,"title":"","content":"The Children of the Baali have been speculated to be both the Earthbound and the Neverborn (who are possibly imprisoned Demon Lords).<br /> <br /> However, it's ultimately up to the ST and they could be something else entirely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T15:37:28-07:00","id":1447047,"title":"","content":"The best explaination is that they are their own thing. <br /> <br /> They are not spirits, they have a physical body. They live in a constant dreaming state that dot match either earthbound nor neverborn, and they are deadly sensitive to sunlight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T15:44:25-07:00","id":1447050,"title":"","content":"I go with Earthbound but I also believe the Baali's belief they are keeping them asleep is complete nonsense and they've been feeding them for millennia.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T19:23:33-07:00","id":1447084,"title":"","content":"I feel like Neverborn is the one that current material leans towards most, though it's been a little while since I've read into the matter.<br /> <br /> Also, the point about them &quot;dreaming&quot; is actually a point in favour of the Neverborn since, AFAIK, the Neverborn Malfeans are described as mostly being asleep and influencing the Spectre Hive-Mind through their dreams?<br /> <br /> The name &quot;Children of the Outer Dark&quot; makes me think of the Lovecraftian horrors of the Deep Umbra.<br /> <br /> PS: regarding the terms &quot;Demons&quot; and &quot;Children,&quot; from the perspective of the Baali, it's a &quot;all Children are Demons, but not all Demons are Children&quot; sort of thing, the Children are a particular sub-set of Demons, if I understand correctly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25886-kharnov","user":"Kharnov","date":". 05-02-2021, 10:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25886-kharnov","name":"Kharnov","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"683"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T00:01:03-07:00","id":1447124,"title":"","content":"There's never been a definitive answer. Popular ones have them as Earthbound, trapped Wyrm Spirits, ancient vampires, Neverborn, demons, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T01:40:09-07:00","id":1447128,"title":"","content":"I don't think V20 did the Baali much justice, and I recommend you'd read earlier books. Though they're a little more... spicy. Black dog territory. <br /> <br /> Now &quot;outer dark&quot; implies they're from outside of creation, deep-umbra style (though not necessarily the deep-middle-umbra). But there are also children in the ground (likely earthbound) and then there's a bunch of other crazy demon shit the Baali are into.<br /> Honestly, the Children are vague so you can create your own story. They might be worshipping Cthulu or the Wyrm or whatever. You can even decide that the Baali are full of shit and their sacrifices were meaningless/really went to an ordinary demon. The Baali aren't one group, there are many, many, many different Baali cults with different interpretations and different objects of worship. The only thing that really seems to be common in baali demon worship are the wells of sacrifice, but they don't agree on the purpose of these wells.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T03:07:03-07:00","id":1447156,"title":"","content":"I've always seen the true Children as being the Neverborn, with their 'bodies' as mere intrusions upon this world of entities that don't neatly fit into creation. The Wells seem like Nihils in Wraith parlance, and fit the descriptions of those (and how they corrupt the world) from Dark Reflections: Spectres.<br /> <br /> The Neverborn also have dreams which are seen as beings of the Outer Dark in Mage, which implies some connection between the two types of entity (see The Book of Madness Revised).<br /> <br /> However, I think various other creatures have been mistaken for Children through the aeons, and these might be Wyrm spirits, Earthbound, Antediluvians or worse. <br /> <br /> The Children are first mentioned in VTDA Clanbook: Baali which was before Earthbound were a thing, so please bear that in mind. <br /> <br /> DTF came along a few years later and then retroactively reinserted itself into the mythos of the other games (e.g., Wraith's high-powered NPCs became Fallen; everything mysterious and exotic but vaguely demonic became Earthbound).<br /> <br /> I prefer the 'mysterious and exotic' answer, rather than the DTF answer. But you also have to bear in mind, every game has its own biases and assumes its cosmology is true. So just filter and adapt for the game you're running.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":5291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","user":"adambeyoncelowe","date":". 05-03-2021, 06:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T03:12:33-07:00","id":1447158,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I think there should be more ambiguity that the Baali actually have no idea what they're talking about. It's a interesting idea that they're basically Sigourney Weaver's group from THE CABIN IN THE WOODS.<br /> <br /> But equally interesting is they're like the Cthulhu cultists.<br /> <br /> &quot;You've been murdering babies on this altar for 5,000 years?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, it keeps the Sleeping Doom asleep.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;But how do you KNOW?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T03:27:51-07:00","id":1447163,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore?p=1447158#post1447158\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly, I think there should be more ambiguity that the Baali actually have no idea what they're talking about. It's a interesting idea that they're basically Sigourney Weaver's group from THE CABIN IN THE WOODS.<br /> <br /> But equally interesting is they're like the Cthulhu cultists.<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;You've been murdering babies on this altar for 5,000 years?&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;Yes, it keeps the Sleeping Doom asleep.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;But how do you KNOW?&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly. They don't know. And it's a highly convenient assumption, right?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T03:30:28-07:00","id":1447164,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore?p=1447163#post1447163\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Exactly. They don't know. And it's a highly convenient assumption, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, the ones who are trying to keep the End of the World from happening have a justification. But, frankly, I kind of think the ones who are just selfish assholes making deals may have the better idea of the three.<br /> <br /> The third ones just worship them as gods, right?<br /> <br /> I understand that each of the Baali founders supposedly each of them had a line that went in a different direction.<br /> <br /> <b>Moloch:</b> Keep the Old Ones Asleep.<br /> <br /> <b>Nergal:</b> Money for nothing and chicks for free. If Nergal is Shaitan, they might also be genuine believers that Hell is the side of good but of a Cenobite rather than sane bent.<br /> <br /> <b>Unknown: </b>No idea what this guy or girl was doing and it might be Ur-Shulgi.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 05-03-2021, 06:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T06:16:31-07:00","id":1447182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore?p=1447164#post1447164\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, the ones who are trying to keep the End of the World from happening have a justification. But, frankly, I kind of think the ones who are just selfish assholes making deals may have the better idea of the three.<br /> <br /> The third ones just worship them as gods, right?<br /> <br /> I understand that each of the Baali founders supposedly each of them had a line that went in a different direction.<br /> <br /> <b>Moloch:</b> Keep the Old Ones Asleep.<br /> <br /> <b>Nergal:</b> Money for nothing and chicks for free. If Nergal is Shaitan, they might also be genuine believers that Hell is the side of good but of a Cenobite rather than sane bent.<br /> <br /> <b>Unknown: </b>No idea what this guy or girl was doing and it might be Ur-Shulgi.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think every iteration of the Baali has the core three slightly different. My reading from their clanbook was that the third progenitor was the sire of the Swarm, but the Swarm got folded into the Molochim later on. I could be misremembering though.<br /> <br /> Ur-Shulgi either as the third (or a quasi fourth progenitor) is one of my favourite Easter eggs, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T06:46:06-07:00","id":1447185,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore?p=1447182#post1447182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think every iteration of the Baali has the core three slightly different. My reading from their clanbook was that the third progenitor was the sire of the Swarm, but the Swarm got folded into the Molochim later on. I could be misremembering though.<br /> <br /> Ur-Shulgi either as the third (or a quasi fourth progenitor) is one of my favourite Easter eggs, too.</div> </div> </div> </div>I also like the implications that Ur-Shulgi isn't some genius master plan to subvert the Assamites.<br /> <br /> No, Haqim brainwashed him completely.<br /> <br /> It's just dude hates religion. Because he's a Baali.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T11:33:22-07:00","id":1447242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore?p=1447047#post1447047\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The best explaination is that they are their own thing.<br /> <br /> They are not spirits, they have a physical body. They live in a constant dreaming state that dot match either earthbound nor neverborn, and they are deadly sensitive to sunlight.</div> </div> </div> </div>The fate of the first of the Children that the Baali's human ancestors unearthed made it seem as if it, and by extension the others, was an ancient and unknown torpid vampire rather than a demon, spirit, or other extradimensional entity. Though I don't think that gibes with Revised-era depiction of the Baali invoking cosmic forces from beyond the stars.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T12:48:38-07:00","id":1447249,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore?p=1447185#post1447185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I also like the implications that Ur-Shulgi isn't some genius master plan to subvert the Assamites.<br /> <br /> No, Haqim brainwashed him completely.<br /> <br /> It's just dude hates religion. Because he's a Baali.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> He's a sorcerer. Hating religion's a sound idea when said religion supresses your style of sorcery.<br /> <br /> I like to use the woman as the 4th. More mysterious that way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T15:00:03-07:00","id":1447276,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore?p=1447242#post1447242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The fate of the first of the Children that the Baali's human ancestors unearthed made it seem as if it, and by extension the others, was an ancient and unknown torpid vampire rather than a demon, spirit, or other extradimensional entity.</div> </div> </div> </div>I tend to agree. Its a vampire supplement, some villagers find a dark and mighty entity asleep that dies screaming in sunlight. Spells old vampires to me. Too physical for Neverborn/Fallen or cosmic horrors. Maybe Antediluvians that went into torpor due to blood loss during the Flood, a Fourth Generation brood, Nicktuku etc. In any case I think its implied that they lied to the villaers to stop them digging them up in the daytime, and drill holes down there that they filled with blood.<br /> <br /> The rest of the Baali were basically taking a lie to seriously. Pretty sure they did find cosmic entities later and kept confusing them with the ones they dug up at the start.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore?p=1447249#post1447249\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He's a sorcerer. Hating religion's a sound idea when said religion supresses your style of sorcery.<br /> <br /> I like to use the woman as the 4th. More mysterious that way.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think there were some serious hints that Shaitan is Rayzeel and not Nergal. Or the two were the same.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2471-trollroot","name":"Trollroot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T15:34:59-07:00","id":1447278,"title":"","content":"Some also suggested that Shaitan might be a corrupted 4th generation than one of the original but honestly I don't think that's a good answer. It also relies on being a bit TOO ashamed of Chaos Factor wackiness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T16:46:55-07:00","id":1447299,"title":"","content":"My favorite interpretation, inspired by the V20 Tal'Mahe'Ra book, is that the Children of the Outer Dark are the sons and daughters of Lilith and Lucifer Embraced by Caine, then slaughtered by the Antediluvians. They are the wraiths of former 2nd Generation vampires created from Nephilim (children of an Angel and a human woman). <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/412-valismedsen","name":"valismedsen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar412_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T23:22:29-07:00","id":1447355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore?p=1447185#post1447185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I also like the implications that Ur-Shulgi isn't some genius master plan to subvert the Assamites.<br /> <br /> No, Haqim brainwashed him completely.<br /> <br /> It's just dude hates religion. Because he's a Baali.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah, completely. I never saw Ur-Shulgi as a plant. Haqim is described as tearing something evil out of him before Embracing him. Though, of course, he was well and truly tainted already by this point.<br /> <br /> I also like the idea that the Baali are the spawn of 3-4 different clans (Salubri, Assamites, Tzimisce and maybe Cappadocian). Whenever an Antediluvian wandered past the Well and succumbed to Frenzy, he or she spawned more of the foul beasts.<br /> <br /> Of course, Baali vitae tastes like Tremere vitae, which means the Salubri origin is most likely, perhaps with Tzimisce close behind (since the original Tremere often experimented with Tzimisce blood to turn themselves).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T23:45:41-07:00","id":1447360,"title":"","content":"This is non-canon but I finally revealed in my most recent campaign that Malkav Embraced his sister, Malakai, and she was the mother of the Malkavians, Salubri, and Baali. All three of them being variations on the same divine/maddening truth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-28T14:05:10-07:00","id":1450069,"title":"","content":"Since this thread has &quot;Baali lore&quot; in the title and I think its a bit to small a question to make a separate thread... In &quot;Chaos Factor&quot; Shaitan has &quot;Alternate Identity&quot; as a Background. It would seem strange to have an alternate identity that no-one knows of, that is pointless. Does anyone know what Shaitans alternate identity was?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2471-trollroot","name":"Trollroot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-28T15:26:57-07:00","id":1450088,"title":"","content":"That's a good catch. I have no idea what the alternate identity might have been, Chaos Factor is one of a handful of books from that era that I haven't seen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-28T15:42:29-07:00","id":1450091,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reasor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore?p=1450088#post1450088\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's a good catch. I have no idea what the alternate identity might have been, Chaos Factor is one of a handful of books from that era that I haven't seen.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks...it always bothered/intrigued me. An alternate identity is by definition an established identity, not a name no-ones heard. Shaitan was last seen in the old world more than three thousand years ago, he has been in torpor since the fall of the Aztecs and even the civilizations that had heard of him are dust. So who is his alternate identity?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2471-trollroot","name":"Trollroot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-28T19:50:32-07:00","id":1450125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Trollroot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore?p=1450069#post1450069\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since this thread has &amp;quot;Baali lore&amp;quot; in the title and I think its a bit to small a question to make a separate thread... In &amp;quot;Chaos Factor&amp;quot; Shaitan has &amp;quot;Alternate Identity&amp;quot; as a Background. It would seem strange to have an alternate identity that no-one knows of, that is pointless. Does anyone know what Shaitans alternate identity was?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nergal? Not sure if it was the original intent, but that would make sense according to the clanbook.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/412-valismedsen","name":"valismedsen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar412_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-28T20:42:56-07:00","id":1450129,"title":"","content":"Alternatively, Shaitan could be riding around in Melinda Gailbraith like she's a suit with Dominate 5.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-29T02:32:40-07:00","id":1450150,"title":"","content":"Was it not Huitzilopochtli? He masqueraded as an Aztec god for centuries.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-29T14:49:29-07:00","id":1450232,"title":"","content":"He's established as Huitzilopochti now, but I get the feeling that this was a retcon that came later. The Baali as a whole have undergone a LOT of rewrites over the years, and Chaos Factor was very early on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-29T18:04:39-07:00","id":1450244,"title":"","content":"Shaitan being the actual Huitzilopochti was right there from The Chaos Factor. In fact, his position as the Aztec god was fairly central to the whole plot.<br /> <br /> Since, I came into the WoD through Mage in the 90\u2019s and it wasn\u2019t until the 2010\u2019s that I finally started exploring Vampire as part of someone\u2019s crossover game, I\u2019ve always run my games as if The Chaos Factor\u2019s take on Shaitan/the Baali was THE canon for the group and thanks to his infernal investments on top of his formidable vampiric powers and age, Shaitan is actually closer in power to an Antediluvian than any extant 4th Gen.<br /> <br /> Throw in the BJD option where Enoch reveals the Antediluvians aren\u2019t actually as powerful as they pretend to be and you get a possible Gehenna setup where Shaitan may actually be as strong or stronger than the genuine Antediluvians and might even be the taint-bringing Father of Darkness whose power comes from the nether realms.<br /> <br /> As to The Children; my personal take in relation to some of my headcanon about all generations\u2019 blood slowly thickening over millennia is that the Caine from which generations are counted isn\u2019t even the first vampire, that there could have been dozens of generations between him and the actual \u201cBlood Caine\u201d (basically the vampire equivalent of Mitochondrial Eve... and which also explains the Laibon and Drowned Legacies... they\u2019re descended from \u201cBlood Caine\u201d but not from Biblical Caine.<br /> <br /> Anyway, that means there are unknown additional generations of vampires that may predate Biblical Caine and are so old that even trying to raise them from their torpor is futile, but they\u2019re also so massively old that False Slumber (Auspex 9) and various other elder disciplines allowed them to influence the world through their \u201cdreams\u201d and their astral selves and possibly forgotten discipline powers would have be mistaken for demonic entities throughout history.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-29T20:16:33-07:00","id":1450260,"title":"","content":"I'm happy to be corrected on the Huitzilopotli issue, and like the concept of &quot;Blood Caine.&quot; I have a fondness for fan theories where the origins of the Curse go many generations further back than the Book of Nod suggests.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-29T21:25:24-07:00","id":1450274,"title":"","content":"To me a \u201cBlood Caine\u201d just makes sense. Given how new vampires are created in the setting there HAS to be a First Vampire of some kind and since there is no way to ever know their real name* and they are almost certainly hopelessly torpid by this point you may as well call this being \u201cCaine\u201d for pretty much the same reason we call our earliest common female ancestor \u201cEve.\u201d<br /> <br /> What gets interesting is the things you can roll into that period, particularly with the realization that the story from the Book of Nod probably came from the Antediluvians and would therefore certainly be propaganda... I mean, which is more impressive? \u201cThe grandchilder of Caine\u201d or \u201cthe 15th-ish (no one knows for sure) generation of vampires\u201d... making 13th Gen actually 25th Gen.<br /> <br /> 15th who killed some of the 14th relative to a 25th Gen isn\u2019t near as fancy as 3rd who killed the 2nd and are judged relative to 13th.<br /> <br /> Anyway, the idea that these pre-\u201c1st\u201d Gens are the demons the Baali worship or are try to keep sleeping is just such a WoD type twist I kinda enjoy<br /> <br /> * Even if they were real, the names recorded in for the first humans in the Bible certainly aren\u2019t what they actually called themselves. Adam is just the 900 BC Hebrew word for \u201cman\u201d and Eve is the same but \u201cwoman\u201d and Cain in that context is Hebrew for \u201ccreated one\u201d (i.e. the first actual child born) and Abel \u201cbreath\u201d (as in lasted as briefly as a breath)... even taking the Bible literally their names would have been in the pre-Babel language and, in a more realistic interpretation, a few hundred years of linguistic drift can render a language unintelligible and this more like a hundred thousand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-31T07:28:54-07:00","id":1450449,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore?p=1450244#post1450244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Shaitan being the actual Huitzilopochti was right there from The Chaos Factor. In fact, his position as the Aztec god was fairly central to the whole plot.<br /> <br /> Since, I came into the WoD through Mage in the 90\u2019s and it wasn\u2019t until the 2010\u2019s that I finally started exploring Vampire as part of someone\u2019s crossover game, I\u2019ve always run my games as if The Chaos Factor\u2019s take on Shaitan/the Baali was THE canon for the group and thanks to his infernal investments on top of his formidable vampiric powers and age, Shaitan is actually closer in power to an Antediluvian than any extant 4th Gen.<br /> <br /> Throw in the BJD option where Enoch reveals the Antediluvians aren\u2019t actually as powerful as they pretend to be and you get a possible Gehenna setup where Shaitan may actually be as strong or stronger than the genuine Antediluvians and might even be the taint-bringing Father of Darkness whose power comes from the nether realms.<br /> <br /> As to The Children; my personal take in relation to some of my headcanon about all generations\u2019 blood slowly thickening over millennia is that the Caine from which generations are counted isn\u2019t even the first vampire, that there could have been dozens of generations between him and the actual \u201cBlood Caine\u201d (basically the vampire equivalent of Mitochondrial Eve... and which also explains the Laibon and Drowned Legacies... they\u2019re descended from \u201cBlood Caine\u201d but not from Biblical Caine.<br /> <br /> Anyway, that means there are unknown additional generations of vampires that may predate Biblical Caine and are so old that even trying to raise them from their torpor is futile, but they\u2019re also so massively old that False Slumber (Auspex 9) and various other elder disciplines allowed them to influence the world through their \u201cdreams\u201d and their astral selves and possibly forgotten discipline powers would have be mistaken for demonic entities throughout history.</div> </div> </div> </div>Can you remember which chapter of BJD had this revelation from Enoch? I don't recall it off the top of my head (though I read it several years ago).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-31T08:31:20-07:00","id":1450452,"title":"","content":"The Omega, one of several potential outcomes of opening the sarcophagus they dig out with Kemintiri's coordinates. As Anatole later points out, Beckett leaves a gap in his narration instead of saying which possibility is true.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23964-el-barto","name":"El Barto","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-31T08:40:05-07:00","id":1450453,"title":"","content":"It's a statement at the end of the book. The last in-character section, I think.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-31T10:04:14-07:00","id":1450464,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore?p=1450453#post1450453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a statement at the end of the book. The last in-character section, I think.</div> </div> </div> </div>That may be why I missed it. Thanks very much!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-31T10:58:13-07:00","id":1450470,"title":"","content":"Yeah, it was deliberately left as just one option... another was that this coffin sealed up many thousands of years ago contained only ashes that, if studied with certain magic would be identified as belonging to a thin-blooded vampire; which would confirm the idea that the blood potency of each generation thickens with time (though measured in centuries to millennia) and at one point Caine and the Antediluvians were as thin-blooded as the 16th Generations of today.<br /> <br /> Which, on its own has some interesting implications in the V20/Revised canon where some of the thinbloods are \u201cInceptors\u201d... vampires who created their own disciplines... something previously believed exclusive only to the Antediluvians.<br /> <br /> Except, if the Antediluvians were once thinblooded themselves and that was the point in time when they were creating their new disciplines... then there\u2019s a link. No one\u2019s been able to do much with disciplines because the general prohibitions against thinblooded progeny kept the blood too thick (one might say \u201ctoo static\u201d) to have the flexibility needed to incept new disciplines.<br /> <br /> And it could have literally been a long con by the Antediluvians to keep anyone else from being able to incept new abilities that could challenge them in ways their current stasis would prevent them from being able to adapt to.<br /> <br /> If you\u2019re running with cyclical Gehennas it could even be the blood getting too thin and new disciplines being incepted that causes the Antediluvians to stir because they need to wipe out the potential threat.<br /> <br /> Take it one step further with the thickening blood and the option that the Antediluvians are NOT as powerful as they pretend to be suggesting that there could be a \u201cmax blood potency\u201d for vampires that they\u2019d all eventually reach if they live long enough and it\u2019s entirely possible that some Antediluvians meet final death in each Gehenna cycle only to have a younger inceptor replace them (and by the time the next Gehenna cycle rolls around in a few thousand years their blood has now reached \u201cmax potency\u201d).<br /> <br /> Basically, Generation only matters for those who haven\u2019t yet reached the thickness of blood where max potency caps things. Caine, the \u201cSecond\u201d and \u201cThird\u201d Generations are all said to be equally strong. But if the \u201cSecond\u201d was actually the 22nd Generation (making what we call the 12th Generation actually the 32nd) and there was still a 12th Generation Vampire around they\u2019d both be equal in power since they\u2019re both at max potency...<br /> <br /> ... and from the point of view of a \u201c5th/25th Gen\u201d sired 5000 years after that... would they even be able to tell the difference? They\u2019re all Blood Gods powerful beyond comprehension and so in stories the \u201cactive\u201d ones when things finally get written down are labeled as the 3rd Generation while those dead or in permanent torpor are labeled the 2nd Generation and their distant progenitor as Caine/the First Generation (which also fits a lot of human psychology in general... we really like the number three and dividing into thirds for some reason and it turns up in myths and stories a lot more than you\u2019d expect for a bilaterally symmetrical species with five digits on each of their four limbs).<br /> <br /> But it also provides a really fun answer for what the Children are, and also potentially some of the other elder evils out there. In Mage the Malfeans worshipped by the Nephandi were said to be the dreams of the sleeping Neverborn, but if you wanted to play with it, the Neverborn themselves might be the psychic manifestations of these elder vampires slumbering eternally beneath the earth.<br /> <br /> Side-bar: in one massive Gehenna/Apocalypse/Armageddon crossover I once ran I mashed the eldest Nephandi Lords, Antediluvians and Maeljin Incarna into being different faces of the same entities. This would essentially be a variation on that thought.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-01T07:06:29-07:00","id":1450584,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447032-question-on-the-children-of-the-outer-dark-baali-lore?p=1450470#post1450470\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, it was deliberately left as just one option... another was t